# Regenerable bulk, deliberately not versioned.
#
# corpus_all.txt  — a 3 MB concatenation of every session transcript, rebuilt by
#                   batch_scan.py. It duplicates content that already lives in
#                   summaries/ and carries no decision of its own.
# */scan.json     — the deterministic scanner output handed TO each agent.
#                   proposals.json is the same structure with the agent's
#                   judgment filled in, so scan.json is strictly superseded.
#
# Everything else here IS versioned on purpose: manifest.json, known_flat.txt,
# AGENT_BRIEF.md, proposals.json, wave*_queue.json and targeted_edits.json are
# the audit trail for every glossary row this batch produced.
corpus_all.txt
*/scan.json
